SUMMARY:Better Together: Analytics Engineering with dbt and Microsoft Fabr
 ic
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\ndbt as a tool helps teams transform
  data in a clean\, structured\, and repeatable way using SQL. A dbt job is
  simply the mechanism that runs those transformations—whether on a sched
 ule\, after data arrives\, or as part of a deployment pipeline.\n\n📌 Th
 is session is a part of a series! Learn more [here](https://developer.micr
 osoft.com/reactor/series/S-1448/?wt.mc_id=meetup_S-1448_webpage_reactor)
