SUMMARY:The Roadmap for Microsoft SQL: Ground to Cloud to Fabric
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nIn the third session in the FabCon 
 and SQLCon recap series we will dive deep into the future of Microsoft SQL
 . From on-premises to Azure and into Microsoft Fabric\, together we will l
 earn about the unified\, AI-ready\, relational database that powers modern
 ization and next-gen AI apps.\n\nYou'll leave this session understanding h
 ow SQL delivers consistency\, performance\, and innovation everywhere you 
 need it.\n\n📍 This session is a part of a series. [Learn more here](htt
 ps://developer.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1660/?wt.mc_id=meetup_S-1660
 _webpage_reactor)
